# CR 614.1c / 707.2 / 614.12: Clone's K:ETBReplacement:Copy is a Copy-layer
# replacement of its own entry. It applies before the ETB trigger check, so
# Clone enters as a copy of the opponent's Venerable Monk, carrying the
# Monk's "when this enters, you gain 2 life" -- which triggers for Clone's
# controller. A 0/0 Clone would die to the next state-based action check;
# the 2/2 copy survives it.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
# Optional$: "you may have Clone enter as a copy", then Choices$
# Creature.Other picks the Monk (Id:6).
queue confirmeffect true
queue cardchoice 6
castspell human 1
# Resolves Clone, then the copied Monk trigger it put on the stack.
resolvestack
# Leave Main1: the state-based action check a 0/0 would not survive.
advance
